model: qwen2.5-coder:14b
files: firmware/bench-one/shared/bench_gemv.h
---
gemv_nib takes a 4-bit value and returns a signed integer.

Output exactly 16 lines, one per input, in this format and nothing else:

n=0 -> 0
n=1 -> 1

Continue for every n from 0 to 15, giving the value gemv_nib returns for each. Numbers only.
